<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3090862852493059354..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Wolves, &quot;Sheepdogs,&quot; and the Gospel of Leviathan </title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>25</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2855063795416914827</id><published>2015-02-25T00:18:54.178-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-25T00:18:54.178-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Its simple really.  Get rid of Paul...get rid of t...</title><content type='html'>Its simple really.  Get rid of Paul...get rid of the problem.  He causes confusion and conflict.  Christians forsake the Tanakh for his sake...they forsake Messiah if need be to keep things square with him.  Ditch the louse before he consigns you to oblivion like he has the above described boobs.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2855063795416914827'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2855063795416914827'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424848734178#c2855063795416914827' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1401929424"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 25, 2015 at 12:18 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2895576452625089958</id><published>2015-02-20T13:34:49.112-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-20T13:34:49.112-07:00</updated><title type='text'>An opportunity to identify their followers, especi...</title><content type='html'>An opportunity to identify their followers, especially the cops.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2895576452625089958'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2895576452625089958'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424464489112#c2895576452625089958' title=''/><author><name>dana</name><uri>http://dangernear.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-81089510"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 20, 2015 at 1:34 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5007519797919894596</id><published>2015-02-20T13:21:03.496-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-20T13:21:03.496-07:00</updated><title type='text'>When I read this article, I immediately thought of...</title><content type='html'>When I read this article, I immediately thought of one of my favorite Mencken quotes:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;The whole aim of practical politics is to keep the populace alarmed (and hence clamorous to be led to safety) by menacing it with an endless series of hobgoblins, all of them imaginary.&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/5007519797919894596'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/5007519797919894596'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424463663496#c5007519797919894596' title=''/><author><name>Some Guy</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1128319214"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 20, 2015 at 1:21 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2493785177465819064</id><published>2015-02-19T09:08:08.132-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-19T09:08:08.132-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I&amp;#39;m not quite ready to get the pitchfork and t...</title><content type='html'>&lt;br /&gt;&lt;i&gt;I&amp;#39;m not quite ready to get the pitchfork and torches after this preacher. He may be like I once was and not yet be aware of the monster he is supporting. Much like a lost soul he needs prayer and someone to share with him the evils of supporting any man made government, especially from the pulpit.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There is wisdom in these words, brother Jarhead. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2493785177465819064'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2493785177465819064'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424362088132#c2493785177465819064' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-a8aojUJZY3w/VLgkHDf4rTI/AAAAAAAALNc/ZNKtkMla2UU/s220/Snapshot_20150115_3.JPG'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 19, 2015 at 9:08 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2076028989891224643</id><published>2015-02-19T08:45:32.608-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-19T08:45:32.608-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Being a sheepdog, IMO, doesn&amp;#39;t mean you work f...</title><content type='html'>Being a sheepdog, IMO, doesn&amp;#39;t mean you work for the government. If people would take responsibility for their own safety by arming themselves there would be one more thing we wouldn&amp;#39;t need the state for.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The trouble is people want to sit back and wait for an officially sanctioned government &amp;quot;servant&amp;quot; to do things that they should just do themselves. This guy seems seriously misdirected and I would quickly find membership at a different church, if I heard anything mildly resembling this at my church.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Well before I was ever aware that there was any option other than Republican (American) or Democrat (Communist)  I served seven years on active duty as a Marine M.P. and for some time I was quite proud of my service. Now, however, I&amp;#39;m embarrassed when it is brought up. Not because I&amp;#39;m ashamed of anything I&amp;#39;ve done but because Republicans always assume I&amp;#39;m one of them. I now consider myself, to borrow Heinlein&amp;#39;s term, a Rational Anarchist.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m not quite ready to get the pitchfork and torches after this preacher. He may be like I once was and not yet be aware of the monster he is supporting. Much like a lost soul he needs prayer and someone to share with him the evils of supporting any man made government, especially from the pulpit.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2076028989891224643'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2076028989891224643'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424360732608#c2076028989891224643' title=''/><author><name>MississippiJarhead</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09200305234961024052</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh6.googleusercontent.com/-7HEcYenjzQ8/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAACE/9A9hON4rSN8/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1388593132"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 19, 2015 at 8:45 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-286508318672320786</id><published>2015-02-18T20:01:59.474-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-18T20:01:59.474-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The guiding principle of American fascism/statism/...</title><content type='html'>The guiding principle of American fascism/statism/communism is destruction of everything stemming from Western culture. &lt;br /&gt;858x70</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/286508318672320786'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/286508318672320786'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424314919474#c286508318672320786' title=''/><link rel='related' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6519438282929353068'/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1818370566"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2015 at 8:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9022491312541266833</id><published>2015-02-18T14:41:22.755-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-18T14:41:22.755-07:00</updated><title type='text'>We are living in 1930&amp;#39;s Nazi Germany! I walked...</title><content type='html'>We are living in 1930&amp;#39;s Nazi Germany! I walked out on &amp;#39;American Sniper&amp;#39;. The guy was an arrogant a-hole. His perception of himself was skewed to say the least. Shooting a lot of people at relatively close ranges in a target rich environment does not mean your opinion matters more then mine. Nor do I need you to defend me. Sheep can be victimized by self-proclaimed &amp;#39;sheepdogs&amp;#39; just as easily as by &amp;#39;wolves&amp;#39;. The &amp;#39;sheep&amp;#39; need to learn to defend themselves, or they will be victimized by arrogant morons (&amp;#39;sheepdogs&amp;#39;) or evil bastards. End result is the same. Being a Biblical &amp;#39;sheep&amp;#39; does not mena you are weak and defenseless. Bathed in the Blood of Jesus Christ we are quite the opposite!People need to read Chuck Baldwin&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;Romans 13&amp;quot;. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/9022491312541266833'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/9022491312541266833'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424295682755#c9022491312541266833' title=''/><author><name>Eric</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1285206508"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2015 at 2:41 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6749526711637952408</id><published>2015-02-18T09:04:31.157-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-18T09:04:31.157-07:00</updated><title type='text'>And I thought Grossman was all for armed citizens-...</title><content type='html'>And I thought Grossman was all for armed citizens- did not know he was just going around promoting the police state.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;Teaching this BS to kids is just brainwashing them into believing the cops are all powerful,all knowing,and they should obey all commands from cops-what a load of sh*t. &lt;br /&gt;I wonder if they&amp;#39;re teaching these kids that it&amp;#39;s ok for the SWAT team to kick your door in at 4am,toss a few flashbangs inside,without checking for innocent people-and babies-and shooting the family dog as they enter your home?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Here in Ohio,Buckeye Firearms Association is constantly promoting LTC Grossman&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;Bulletproof your mind&amp;quot; course.&lt;br /&gt;Their coverage of his course mentions nothing about his traveling around with the other guys and dispensing&amp;quot;religious advice&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It would seem Buckeye Firearms either doesn&amp;#39;t know,or doesn&amp;#39;t care about Grossman&amp;#39;s support of the police state-although BFA does tend to mention a lot of cops attending the course every time Grossman is in town.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Now,it seems like Grossman is part of the team that&amp;#39;s teaching all this &amp;quot;worship the police&amp;quot; horsepucky in churches across the country.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6749526711637952408'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6749526711637952408'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424275471157#c6749526711637952408' title=''/><author><name>gamegetter II</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11963151027331481180</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='//lh3.googleusercontent.com/-EWU7ks0ItYs/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAADU/cwfW7eLAlN0/s512-c/photo.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1752744304"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2015 at 9:04 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6829579041947011143</id><published>2015-02-18T08:35:49.689-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-18T08:35:49.689-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;That power [Civil Government] which is oblig...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;That power [Civil Government] which is obliged, and appointed to command and rule justly and religiously, for the good of the people, and is only set over them on these conditions, and for that end, cannot tie them to subjection without resistance, when the power is abused to the destruction of laws, religion, and people; but all power is so obliged and appointed: therefore, whensoever it is so abused, it cannot tie people to subjection, but rather oblige them to rejection of it.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;...&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;If then obedience to magistrates be duty, and non-obedience sin, and obedience to tyrants sin, and non-obedience duty; then by parity of reason, subjection to magistrates is duty, and non–subjection is sin, and also subjection to tyrants is sin, and non-subjection duty&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;...&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;Under both Testaments, the people of God frequently in times of persecution have defended, vindicated, or recovered their religion and liberties by defensive arms, resisting the sovereign powers that sought to destroy them: therefore this may and ought to be done again, when these religious, civil, and natural privileges, are in the like hazard to be destroyed by the violent encroachments of the sovereign powers.&amp;quot; [cites numerous examples]&lt;br /&gt;...&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;We have in the scriptures many promises of the Lord’s approving and countenancing the duty of defensive arms, even against their oppressing rulers.&amp;quot; [lists them]&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Defensive Arms Vindicated by Mr. Alexander Shields, Minister of the Gospel&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.truecovenanter.com/shields/shields_hll_head5.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6829579041947011143'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6829579041947011143'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424273749689#c6829579041947011143' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1024508530"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2015 at 8:35 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4437003812108585308</id><published>2015-02-18T08:29:02.390-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-18T08:29:02.390-07:00</updated><title type='text'>SICK.&#xa;&#xa;Number 1:  Jesus was not speaking to believ...</title><content type='html'>SICK.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Number 1:  Jesus was not speaking to believers today in the “red letters” of most Bibles.  His earthly ministry was to Israel and Israel alone.  Putting forth the idea that the sermon on the mount is for believers today is as preposterous as saying God wants me to build an Ark as the world will soon be flooded.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Number 2:  Romans 13 does clearly state that God does in fact have “ministers of wrath” ordained to execute vengeance upon evil doers.  HOWEVER; in the same context the verses CLEARLY state that these ministers are “NOT a terror to good works, but to evil”.  When “ministers” become a terror to good works they MUST be resisted.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;In Romans 13, like in Romans 12, Paul is describing the IDEAL… the ideal government (13) and the ideal believer (12).  This is what we as believers in and out of government are to aspire to.  It is not what we are, especially the unsaved and unlearned of scripture.  The notion that we should bow to all government authority, no matter what, is an absolutely polluted scriptural idea used by satan to brainwash and control people who do not read the Bible God gave them.  If that were the case, we should bow to satan himself as he is IN AUTHORITY over the earth right now.  And there you have it…</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/4437003812108585308'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/4437003812108585308'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424273342390#c4437003812108585308' title=''/><author><name>Ted Lindblad III</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1629046428"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2015 at 8:29 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5123414054879997420</id><published>2015-02-18T08:09:22.049-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-18T08:09:22.049-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Can&amp;#39;t you see just picture it: Jesus standing ...</title><content type='html'>Can&amp;#39;t you see just picture it: Jesus standing before the throng . . . clad in a Praetorian or Centurion uniform?!  Sigh!!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/5123414054879997420'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/5123414054879997420'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424272162049#c5123414054879997420' title=''/><author><name>rkshanny</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1121638985"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 18, 2015 at 8:09 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7741757515696663268</id><published>2015-02-17T11:34:27.973-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-17T11:34:27.973-07:00</updated><title type='text'>the pic of kellogg, a preacher, in that uniform pu...</title><content type='html'>the pic of kellogg, a preacher, in that uniform puts me off immensely.  this would be the case even if his message was purely libertarian in content.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;we are a confused nation.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/7741757515696663268'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/7741757515696663268'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424198067973#c7741757515696663268' title=''/><author><name>kirk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1319787240"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 17, 2015 at 11:34 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6274945296952133017</id><published>2015-02-17T06:39:01.355-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-17T06:39:01.355-07:00</updated><title type='text'>These hucksters are perverting scripture and ultim...</title><content type='html'>These hucksters are perverting scripture and ultimately trample upon the promises clearly spelled out in the very bible they falsely claim obedience to.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The Good Shepherd does not need dogs:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The LORD is my shepherd; I shall not want.&lt;br /&gt;He makes me lie down in green pastures.&lt;br /&gt;He leads me beside still waters.&lt;br /&gt;He restores my soul.&lt;br /&gt;He leads me in paths of righteousness for his name&amp;#39;s sake.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;Even though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death,&lt;br /&gt;I will fear no evil,&lt;br /&gt;for you are with me;&lt;br /&gt;your rod and your staff,&lt;br /&gt;they comfort me.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;You prepare a table before me in the presence of my enemies;&lt;br /&gt;you anoint my head with oil;&lt;br /&gt;my cup overflows.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Surely goodness and mercy shall follow me all the days of my life,&lt;br /&gt;and I shall dwell in the house of the LORD forever.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(Psalm 23 ESV)&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6274945296952133017'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6274945296952133017'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424180341355#c6274945296952133017' title=''/><author><name>Enigmatic</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/bl