 minister: &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;STATISM. n. … 2. the doctrine[religion] or practice of vesting economic control, economic planning, etc. in a centralized state government: the current sense. Webster’s New Twentieth Century Dictionary, Unabridged (1969), p. 1778&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;http://www.suijurisforum.com/frivolous-lawsuits-t1425-30.html#p8528&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/5501921555413162211'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/5501921555413162211'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1424014873491#c5501921555413162211' title=''/><author><name>ckgomaz</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-660869598"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 15, 2015 at 8:41 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1083385725461471791</id><published>2015-02-15T07:35:00.756-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-15T07:35:00.756-07:00</updated><title type='text'>From one Texan to the rest, &amp;quot;Forget the Alamo...</title><content type='html'>From one Texan to the rest, &amp;quot;Forget the Alamo, remember Waco!&amp;quot;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://