ame>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2139620651"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 15, 2015 at 7:32 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5102898407864680111</id><published>2015-02-13T18:31:45.767-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-13T18:31:45.767-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Donna from North Dakota...&#xa;&#xa;&amp;quot;My heritage is A...</title><content type='html'>Donna from North Dakota...&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&amp;quot;My heritage is Arabic. In Arab culture, the absolute worst thing you can call a man is a dog.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m pretty sure dogs aren&amp;#39;t well regarded in the New Testament, either! Actually, I&amp;#39;m beginning to wonder if many who call themselves &amp;#39;Christian&amp;#39; have a dedicated  familiarity with scripture.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Anyway, isn&amp;#39;t it &amp;#39;shepherds&amp;#39; who provide watch care for the flock based upon the example of Christ&amp;#39;s mortal ministry? Over a period of 25 years, I&amp;#39;ve had two &amp;#39;sheepdogs&amp;#39; go rogue by shredding the hind legs of their charges.  I don&amp;#39;t keep sheepdogs anymore.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/5102898407864680111'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/5102898407864680111'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1423877505767#c5102898407864680111' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1850099741"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 13, 2015 at 6:31 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-27618117838252092</id><published>2015-02-13T01:52:06.468-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-13T01:52:06.468-07:00</updated><title type='text'>This sounds reminiscent of what the Bolsheviks had...</title><content type='html'>This sounds reminiscent of what the Bolsheviks had done in Russia, by infiltrating the Russian Orthodox church,thereby making it into a state organ; utilizing the same &amp;quot;useful idiots&amp;quot; to encourage state worship. I can&amp;#39;t agree with you more, William, keep up the good work &amp;amp; God bless. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/27618117838252092'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/27618117838252092'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1423817526468#c27618117838252092' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1258056065"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 13, 2015 at 1:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6519438282929353068</id><published>2015-02-13T01:37:19.676-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-13T01:37:19.676-07:00</updated><title type='text'>My heritage is Arabic.  In Arab culture, the absol...</title><content type='html'>My heritage is Arabic.  In Arab culture, the absolute worst thing you can call a man is a dog.&lt;br /&gt;There is a large difference between American style fascism and the German style of the mid-20th century, and that is this:  It seems to me that the Nazis had an actual philosophy behind what they were doing.  their movement called for the perfection of man by better breeding, thus the whole master race thing.  In America, we have no such driving philosophy.  What is driving American culture toward the abyss is fear.  The result is the same, but it does explain a few major differences, such as the lack of a coherent movement or overt goals in the American style fascism.  &lt;br /&gt;But in both cases, the mainstream Christians are dead set behind these movements.  And that is a frightening place to be.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6519438282929353068'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/6519438282929353068'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1423816639676#c6519438282929353068' title=''/><author><name>PaulTheCabDriver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1306742157"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 13, 2015 at 1:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1229797145508036523</id><published>2015-02-12T18:38:33.214-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-12T18:38:33.214-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I am a man, not a canine of any kind or a sheep.  ...</title><content type='html'>I am a man, not a canine of any kind or a sheep.     If you consider yourself a dog, it doesn&amp;#39;t speak very highly of you. Dogs exist to serve men.  They obey our commands or they are put down.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/1229797145508036523'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/1229797145508036523'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1423791513214#c1229797145508036523' title=''/><author><name>Chris Mallory</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13001920155309388738</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='31' height='25' src='http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-DTy4v_qd_7s/Uy823oj8mgI/AAAAAAAAAFg/PkIaN0O1D-w/s220/images.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1685275614"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 12, 2015 at 6:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2793773621903173629</id><published>2015-02-12T11:38:55.092-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-12T11:38:55.092-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I test my interpretation of &amp;quot;Obey the powers ...</title><content type='html'>I test my interpretation of &amp;quot;Obey the powers that be&amp;quot; by:&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;1). Acts 4 where Peter and John state it&amp;#39;s better to obey God than men.&lt;br /&gt;2). Daniel 3 where the 3 Hebrews refused to worship the Graven Image as commanded.&lt;br /&gt;3).  Daniel 6 where Daniel refused the command to pray only to the head of government.&lt;br /&gt;4).  Exodus 1 where the Hebrew midwives disobeyed the command to kill Hebrew male babies as they were born.&lt;br /&gt;5).  In the book of Matthew, Herod sent his soldiers to kill all the male children less than 2 years of age in the village. Would I have helped the soldiers kill the children? Would I have just shut my door and minded my own business? Or, would I have picked up a sword and actively helped the parents and children escape; killing a soldier, if need be?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I wonder what Elijah would say about this? It&amp;#39;s not as if he was an active supporter of &amp;quot;government&amp;quot; (Ahab and Jezebel). In fact, most or virtually all of the prophets were not overly supportive of &amp;quot;government&amp;quot;.&lt;br /&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2793773621903173629'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/comments/default/2793773621903173629'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html?showComment=1423766335092#c2793773621903173629' title=''/><author><name>The Confederate Celt</name><uri>http://theconfederatecelt.com</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2015/02/wolves-sheepdogs-and-gospel-of-leviathan.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3090862852493059354' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3090862852493059354' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-974935042"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="February 12, 2015 at 11:38 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1988600468013424694</id><published>2015-02-12T10:34:31.055-07:00</published><updated>2015-02-12T10:34:31.055-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I am the sheepdog of my family, and  I don&amp;#39;t r...</title><content type='html'>I am the sheepdog of my family, and  I don&amp;#39;t recall delegating my responsibility to anyone else.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3090862852493059354/co